WEBVTT

00:05:27.128 --> 00:05:31.182
Koliko sam samo pogrešio.

00:05:31.182 --> 00:05:35.715
1987., u mesecu kada je rođen
naš najstariji sin, Džerard,

00:05:35.715 --> 00:05:38.169
dobio sam prvi računar za slepe,

00:05:38.169 --> 00:05:41.383
i on je zapravo ovde.

00:05:41.383 --> 00:05:43.318
Da li ga vidite?

00:05:43.318 --> 00:05:47.601
I vidite da nema, kako vi to zovete,
nema monitor.

00:05:47.601 --> 00:05:51.919
(Smeh)

00:05:51.919 --> 00:05:53.913
To je slepi računar.

00:05:53.913 --> 00:05:55.813
(Smeh)

00:05:55.813 --> 00:05:58.418
To je Kinout Gold 84k,

00:05:58.418 --> 00:06:02.594
i 84k označava 84 kilobajta memorije.